        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-DECORB1-18-US15, Art Deco Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor over 10 years, First Impressions has been designing and manufacturing the most amazing custom door pulls for homes and business, right here is the U.S.A. Dress up your doors with these 18\" hand made art deco design door pulls made of  brass and hand finished in satin nickel.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis back to back mounted pair of Deco Pulls can be mounted on Wood, Fiberglass, Metal or Glass doors. Just select the thickness of you door in the options below so we include the correct length mounting screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions PR-DECORB1-18-US15 Deco Door Pulls:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Nickel</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pair of Pulls (2 Pulls) bolt to each other through the door. </li>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 door pull handles).</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\nOnly (1) Pair Left.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Deco Design Door Pull, First Impressions DECORB1",
                "description": "First Impressions DECORB1 Art Deco Door Pulls. For over 10 years, First Impressions has been designing and manufacturing the most amazing  custom  door pulls for homes and business, right here is the U.S.A. Dress up your doors with these all new art deco design door pulls made of solid brass and hand finished in your choice of 6 different high quality finishes. Available in sizes up to 6 feet in your choice of 6 different finish colors.",
